 houdt. Een verpleegster krijgt het meisje mee, maar brengt haar niet naar de inrichting die hij heeft uitgekozen. Ze voedt het kind zelf op. De roman volgt de gescheiden levens die hieruit ontstaan en laat zien hoe een verzwegen gebeurtenis binnen een gezin blijft doorwerken.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/24271/gebroken-licht.html","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-052.json","sources":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/24271/gebroken-licht.html","role":"Primary ISBN registry; exact existing2010 paperback, Dutch language and substantial narrative evidence","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p318266377","role":"Pinned exact ISBN9789063053994, Dutch title/author and original English2005 Work; reused immutable prior source","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://www.bol.com/nl/nl/p/gebroken-licht/1001004006434702/","role":"Exact paperback9789063053994, Dutch language and matching dark baby-dress front; incorrect CapturingLight field rejected","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://openlibrary.org/books/OL47796603M.json","role":"New bounded exact existing-edition read; ISBN/parent/publisher; no language or cover field present","receipt":"edition-OL47796603M.json","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"}],"decision":"Reuse Work1903 and author966, following the already checked PR71 identity routing. Do not create a new Work for TheMemoryKeeper''sDaughter/OL1921530W. Existing2078/ISBN9789029574891 is a2010 Dutch paperback of the same book; exact open record and BureauISBN agree. Its merchant CapturingLight original-title field is rejected. New2009/2010 reprint ISBN9789063053994 has its own reviewed front and is not asserted to be the2010 ISBN cover. Date disagreement is not silently resolved.","additionalCredits":[]},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","source":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/24271/gebroke