tbrekende lichaam loopt daardoor samen met vragen over geld, vertrouwen en bestuurlijke verantwoordelijkheid.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://www.singeluitgeverijen.nl/de-geus/boek/labyrint/","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-224.json","sources":[{"url":"https://www.singeluitgeverijen.nl/de-geus/boek/labyrint/","role":"Primary publisher exact selected Dutch paperback ISBN, translator/title and skull/fraud investigation narrative","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p330312073","role":"Pinned exact Dutch originalLabyrinten2000","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://www.deslegte.com/labyrint-164545/","role":"Fuller same novel content including Louises husbands municipal role; different2007ISBN used for content only","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"}],"decision":"Remove imprint De Geus from title, not a second book. Exact publisher/KB bind Labyrint to Labyrinten2000; this is LouiseRehnström investigation, not Wallander novel, Borges Labyrinths or another authors Labyrint. Existing Mankell corpus and Dutch/original titles compared; source author shared WikidataQ193346 reuses author857. Current duplicate preflight still mandatory.","additionalCredits":[]},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","source":"https://www.singeluitgeverijen.nl/de-geus/boek/labyrint/","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","reference":null},{"type":"exact_edition_front_review","receipt":"cover-normal-12033207.json","sha256":"eefbb1026eb8143b5c83e89696fd32f9145f225dab6c0360d917ff4d374bd1cd","bytes":20311,"review":"Decoded exact Dutch DeGeus front: HenningMankell/Labyrint, dark coast/red hut/lighthouse. Correct title/author/imprint; no barcode assertion.","limitation":"Front/source binding; no barcode claim, hosted loading not yet proven"}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"202