e-lied/501630449","role":"Exact Dutch paperback9789401625319; distinct ebook/audio ISBNs excluded","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"}],"decision":"Preserve Work1530 for the2025 revised LastLoveSong. No merging with an earlier LosingYou Work and no first-publication-year correction. Exact ISBN, parent and library record agree. HarryWhittaker''s revision role is retained in provenance; EricaDisco is translator, not primary author.","additionalCredits":[]},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","source":"https://www.xanderuitgevers.nl/boeken/het-laatste-lied-lucinda-riley/","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","reference":null},{"type":"exact_edition_front_review","receipt":"cover-15157928.json","sha256":"cf05286a6e9fe43ae40c7dc66a5063ef6e2316bd2aeec24a0e7815d1b0e12953","bytes":49754,"review":"Decoded front read: LUCINDA RILEY / HET LAATSTE LIED / Xander mark, coast-house-flower design. Consistent with the ISBN-bound edition and publisher front. No barcode/printing-year claim.","limitation":"Front/source binding; no barcode claim, hosted loading not yet proven"}],"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:12.630Z","review_batch":"nl-continuation-20261103-001"}},{"ref":"d350","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":1535,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":1535,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":821,"text":"Edith Eger bouwt voort op de ervaringen en inzichten die zij eerder in De keuze beschreef. Dit boek richt zich op patronen in denken en handelen die volgens haar de verhouding tot het verleden kunnen bepalen. Ze nodigt lezers uit hun eigen reacties te onderzoeken en anders naar vastgelopen situaties te kijken. Persoonlijke reflectie krijgt daarbij een praktische vorm. De tekst biedt haar benadering van innerlijke vrijheid, zonder dat daarmee een vaste uitkomst voor iedere lezer wordt beloofd.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://rozet.nl/catalogus/1998177/","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-350.json","sources":[{"url":"https://www.awbruna.nl/boek/non-fictie/edith-eger/het-geschenk/","role":"Primary publisher; hardcover ISBN, translator, imprint and public biography links Edith/EdithEvaEger","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://rozet.nl/catalogus/1998177/","role":"Exact2020 Dutch edition, PPN429102410, translator and substantive contemporary library review","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"}],"decision":"The exact ISBN-bound KB alias Eger, Edith resolves to source author EdithEger/EdithEvaEger, not a second person. Preserve Work1535 and author821. Publisher and library bind the Dutch2020 hardcover. Current publisher synopsis mixes in revised-edition chapters; do not ascribe those additions to the2020 printing. Current exact-title collision reviewed separately: EdithEger psychological non-fiction2020 ISBN9789400512252 vs GaeaSchoeters elephant political novel ISBN9789025318604. Preserve both Works, no copy/merge/overwrite.","additionalCredits":[]},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","source":"https://rozet.nl/catalogus/1998177/","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","reference":null},{"type":"exact_edition_front_review","receipt":"cover-15139536.json","sha256":"34c78e4d7221360dd54744a45f357c8faa02a020199cc6eb4604d7883e455037","bytes":23609,"review":"Decoded Dutch front read: EDITH EGER / Het GESCHENK /12lessen die je leven kunnen redden, pale blue-green background and key. Exact edition/source association retained; no barcode or printing-year assertion.","limitation":"Front/source binding; no barcode claim, hosted loading not yet proven"}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:12.630Z","review_batch":"nl-continuation-20261103-001"}},{"ref":"m350","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_id":1643},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":1643,"work_id":1535,"bound_author_id