ding not yet proven"}],"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:12.630Z","review_batch":"nl-continuation-20261103-001"}},{"ref":"d356","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":1491,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":1491,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":738,"text":"Rosa en haar vrienden hebben in Portugal een eigen plek gevonden, de Geheime Tuin. Hun geluk berust echter op een onzekere basis: ze mogen er niet zomaar wonen. Intussen maken oude en nieuwe liefdes het moeilijk om te bepalen welke kant hun leven op moet. In dit vervolg op de volwassen Hoe overleef ik-trilogie botsen verwachtingen met de werkelijkheid. De vrienden moeten onderzoeken wat zij zelf willen, hoe goed zij elkaar kennen en welke risico’s zij durven nemen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://www.singeluitgeverijen.nl/volt/boek/hoe-overleef-ik-alles-wat-anders-gaat-dan-gedacht/","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-356.json","sources":[{"url":"https://www.singeluitgeverijen.nl/volt/boek/hoe-overleef-ik-alles-wat-anders-gaat-dan-gedacht/","role":"Primary publisher; content, author, series scope and exact hardcover ISBN","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1957841/hoe-overleef-ik-alles-wat-anders-gaat-dan-verwacht.html","role":"Dutch language, hardback ISBN and imprint; URL uses a preliminary wording but record title agrees","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://rozet.nl/catalogus/2534219/","role":"Exact ISBN/PPN444702512 and book-specific library review","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"}],"decision":"Exact ISBN joins the publisher, BureauISBN, library and current Work1491. The publisher''s credited FrancineOomen resolves the full-name authority mismatch; no author or Work merge. Hardcover ISBN is distinct from9789062226467ebook and9789062226450audio. This is part2 of the adult follow-up trilogy, not part2 of every earlier Hoeoverleefik sequence.","additionalCredits":[]},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","source":"https://www.singeluitgeverijen.nl/volt/boek/hoe-overleef-ik-alles-wat-anders-gaat-dan-gedacht/","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","reference":null},{"type":"exact_edition_front_review","receipt":"cover-15137967.json","sha256":"16912dc5324dbb30f5bd3ee78c47791290fca0f62ade85bb7df202da7c61a202","bytes":73928,"review":"Decoded front read: FrancineOomen / Hoe overleef ik ALLES WAT ANDERS GAAT DAN GEDACHT?, blue sky, green house and illustrated Rosa vehicle. Exact Dutch title agrees; front alone is not a barcode or printing-year proof.","limitation":"Front/source binding; no barcode claim, hosted loading not yet proven"}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:12.630Z","review_batch":"nl-continuation-20261103-001"}},{"ref":"m356","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_id":1579},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":1579,"work_id":1491,"bound_author_id":738,"bound_title":"Hoe overleef ik alles wat anders gaat dan gedacht?","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"9789062225644","format":"hardcover","cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/15137967-L.jpg?default=false","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/15137967-M.jpg?default=false","evidence_url":"https://www.singeluitgeverijen.nl/volt/boek/hoe-overleef-ik-alles-wat-anders-gaat-dan-gedacht/","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-356.json","sources":[{"url":"https://www.singeluitgeverijen.nl/volt/boek/hoe-overleef-ik-alles-wat-anders-gaat-dan-gedacht/","role":"Primary publisher; content, author, series scope and exact hardcover ISBN","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1957841/hoe-overleef-ik-alles-wat-anders-gaat-dan-verwacht.html","role":"Dutch language, hardback ISBN and imprint; URL uses a preliminary wording but record title agrees","