127","isbn_13":"9789027491121","language":"dut","publisher":"Het Spectrum","title":"De rode letter"}},{"ref":"d377","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":315,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":315,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":197,"text":"In het puriteinse Boston wordt Hester Prynne publiekelijk veroordeeld omdat zij een kind heeft gekregen buiten haar huwelijk. Een rode letter op haar kleding moet haar misstap voor iedereen zichtbaar maken. Terwijl ze haar dochter opvoedt, krijgt ze te maken met uitsluiting en een gemeenschap die over haar leven oordeelt. Anderen dragen schuld die minder gemakkelijk te zien is. Hawthorne onderzoekt hoe openlijke bestraffing, verborgen waarheid en het verlangen naar vergelding de verhoudingen tussen mensen bepalen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/318173/the-scarlet-letter-by-nathaniel-hawthorne-foreword-by-tom-perrotta-introduction-by-robert-milder-notes-by-thomas-e-connolly/","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-377.json","sources":[{"url":"https://www.oupjapan.co.jp/en/products/detail/5689?language=en","role":"Primary academic publisher, Boston/Hester/child/scarletA social punishment premise","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/318173/the-scarlet-letter-by-nathaniel-hawthorne-foreword-by-tom-perrotta-introduction-by-robert-milder-notes-by-thomas-e-connolly/","role":"Primary publisher, central characters/community and hidden guilt; ending not used","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p801785294","role":"Pinned exact Dutch ISBN/title/language and original1850","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://openlibrary.org/books/OL24356706M","role":"Pinned printed Spectrum hardcover, same source-bound cover","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"}],"decision":"Existing Work315 retained. Exact Dutch Spectrum hardcover9789027491121 is Hawthorne1850 novel, not adaptation or introduction by later editor. Original Work and Dutch edition title remain distinct; no new Work for translated title.","additionalCredits":[]},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","source":"https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/318173/the-scarlet-letter-by-nathaniel-hawthorne-foreword-by-tom-perrotta-introduction-by-robert-milder-notes-by-thomas-e-connolly/","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","reference":null},{"type":"exact_edition_front_review","receipt":"cover-6582599.json","sha256":"c49a6447a5cea0ed94f649fcaa07bbc7e7478dc2f28db7745d569a1e79de5ada","bytes":27891,"review":"Decoded green Spectrum Klassieken front, NathanielHawthorne/De rode letter, yellow engraving panel. Correct Dutch ISBN-linked hardcover; signs of age remain, no English front substituted.","limitation":"Front/source binding; no barcode claim, hosted loading not yet proven"}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:12.630Z","review_batch":"nl-continuation-20261103-001"}},{"ref":"m377","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_id":"@e377"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@e377","work_id":315,"bound_author_id":197,"bound_title":"De rode letter","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"9789027491121","format":"hardcover","cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/6582599-L.jpg?default=false","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/6582599-M.jpg?default=false","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p801785294","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-377.json","sources":[{"url":"https://www.oupjapan.co.jp/en/products/detail/5689?language=en","role":"Primary academic publisher, Boston/Hester/child/scarletA social punishment premise","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/318173/the-scarlet-letter-by-nathaniel-hawthor