"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":2608,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":1256,"text":"De tweeling Estha en Rahel groeit op in Zuid-India, in een familie waar liefde en afkomst aan strenge verwachtingen gebonden zijn. De komst van hun nichtje Sophie brengt verhoudingen in beweging die de kinderen nog niet kunnen overzien. Hun waarnemingen worden verbonden met gebeurtenissen die jaren later blijven doorwerken. Arundhati Roy vertelt over familiebanden en over de gevolgen wanneer iemand de ongeschreven regels van een gemeenschap doorbreekt. Juist kleine gebaren blijken een grote invloed op de levens van de betrokkenen te hebben.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/158400/the-god-of-small-things-by-arundhati-roy/9780812979657/","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-391.json","sources":[{"url":"https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/158400/the-god-of-small-things-by-arundhati-roy/9780812979657/","role":"Primary publisher; Estha/Rahel childhood and cousinSophie arrival/family constraints","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p265544378","role":"Pinned exact Dutch title/language/author and original1997","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://openlibrary.org/books/OL35687461M","role":"Pinned exact printed Pockethuis edition","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"}],"decision":"Retain Work2608 and Roy authority1256. Exact Dutch Pockethuis ISBN9789046140536/KB original1997 binds full novel; no new Work for translated title. Publisher current English/Spanish ISBN used for narrative, not copied into Dutch edition.","additionalCredits":[]},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","source":"https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/158400/the-god-of-small-things-by-arundhati-roy/9780812979657/","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","reference":null},{"type":"exact_edition_front_review","receipt":"