ty","reference":"reviewed-488.json","sources":[{"url":"https://www.uitgeverijdefontein.nl/boek/het-leven-van-een-loser/","role":"Exact Dutch hardcover ISBN9789026125690, first-volume text and translator","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p320739929","role":"Pinned exact first diary, Dutch title and original Greg Heffley journal2007","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://natlib.govt.nz/records/31863971","role":"Independent national bibliography: ISBN9780141344980 is The Third Wheel2012, series volume7; resolves title-only collision with Work480","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"}],"decision":"Resolved false duplicate signal using exact ISBN, not title alone: Work1884/edition2056 is first diary (Greg Heffley journal2007); Work480 is The Third Wheel, whose English edition480 has misleading generic series title but ISBN9780141344980 identifies volume7. Preserve both Works, all links and scores. No merge. Work480 title/year cleanup is separate, outside this proposal. This replaces the provisional conflict classification recorded before inspecting Work480.","additionalCredits":[]},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","source":"https://www.uitgeverijdefontein.nl/boek/het-leven-van-een-loser/","provenance":"prior_original_source_reviewed_summary","reference":"content-review-020.json"},{"type":"exact_edition_front_review","receipt":"cover-14812548.json","sha256":"551316b78f2701ddfb97659be0d9bab012b7be2a043830a007c32668f611a365","bytes":43034,"review":"Decoded red first-volume Dutch front, Het leven van een Loser, Jeff Kinney and illustrated boy on torn diary paper. Same ISBN/source cover, no barcode assertion.","limitation":"Front/source binding; no barcode claim, hosted loading not yet proven"}],"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:12.630Z","review_batch":"nl-continuation-20261103-001"}},{"ref":"d489","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":1655,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":1655,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":42,"text":"Een vermoorde natuurkundige in Zwitserland draagt een teken dat Robert Langdon in verband brengt met de Illuminati. Het onderzoek krijgt haast wanneer een dreiging tegen het Vaticaan wordt aangekondigd, juist terwijl de kardinalen bijeenkomen om een paus te kiezen. Samen met de Italiaanse wetenschapper Vittoria Vetra zoekt Langdon in Rome naar aanwijzingen. Kunstwerken, oude symbolen en verborgen locaties vormen een route door de stad, terwijl de tijd om een aanslag te voorkomen steeds korter wordt.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://danbrown.com/books/novels/angels-and-demons/","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-489.json","sources":[{"url":"https://danbrown.com/books/novels/angels-and-demons/","role":"Primary author; full novel2000, murdered physicist, Illuminati, Vatican threat and VittoriaVetra. Only synopsis facts used, no excerpt copied.","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p297098268","role":"Pinned exact Dutch ISBN/title/author and original-title binding","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://www.bol.com/nl/nl/p/het-bernini-mysterie/1001004001953796/","role":"Exact Dutch paperback9789024547906 and title/author/front corroboration","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"}],"decision":"Preserve Work1655, author42 and exact full Dutch paperback. Exact KB original title is Angels&Demons2000; source Work''s links to partial1/2 or1/3editions and combined DaVinciCode volumes are not the selected edition. Dutch selected ISBN is independently confirmed; no taste/series/ranking changes.","additionalCredits":[]},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","source":"https://danbrown.com/books/novels/angels-and-demons/","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","reference":null},{"type":"exact_edition_front_review","receipt":"cover-13729122.json","sha256":"4ce34b29d169a8abb199506