g claim; retain cover evidence separately from uncertain reprint date.","limitation":"Front/source binding; no barcode claim, hosted loading not yet proven"}],"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:12.630Z","review_batch":"nl-continuation-20261103-001"}},{"ref":"d499","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":2984,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":2984,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":23,"text":"Na de dood van meneer Nancy ontdekken zijn zoons dat zij meer met elkaar delen dan een vader. Ze zijn als kinderen van elkaar gescheiden en hebben heel verschillende levens opgebouwd. Hun kennismaking brengt ook een onverwachte familiegeschiedenis aan het licht: hun vader was een verschijning van de West-Afrikaanse god Anansi. Terwijl de broers hun onderlinge verhouding onderzoeken, raken gewone gebeurtenissen verweven met goddelijke erfenissen. De roman volgt hun verwikkelingen zonder een vervolg op American Gods te vormen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://www.neilgaiman.com/works/books/anansi%2Bboys/ed/134/","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-499.json","sources":[{"url":"https://www.neilgaiman.com/works/books/anansi%2Bboys/ed/134/","role":"Primary author, novel identity and Charlie/unknown brother/Anansi narrative","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://boekenbalie.nl/de-bende-van-anansi/9789024553853","role":"Public search extract exact ISBN, Dutch paperback; direct open cache miss, not claimed complete page read","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://openlibrary.org/books/OL28294204M","role":"Pinned Dutch edition and translator Emmy van Beest; source record bound to Work2984","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"}],"decision":"Preserve Work2984 and Dutch edition3143. Full novel, not comic adaptation, TV edition, omnibus or sequel to American Gods. No new Work/edition. National-library extract absent for this ISBN; exact Dutch paperback corroborated by independent retailer plus source translator statement.","additionalCredits":[]},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","source":"https://www.neilgaiman.com/works/books/anansi%2Bboys/ed/134/","provenance":"prior_original_source_reviewed_summary","reference":"content-review-020.json"},{"type":"exact_edition_front_review","receipt":"cover-12049561.json","sha256":"17d62c009de6cc622a817bb010524267cfb1fd1b1a9c926a3cb5e9aadcf30c61","bytes":65985,"review":"Decoded Dutch front, Neil Gaiman / De bende van Anansi, blue lightning/web and city. Library-exemplar sticker obscures lower artwork, does not obscure title/author. Imperfection retained explicitly, not counted as placeholder.","limitation":"Front/source binding; no barcode claim, hosted loading not yet proven"}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:12.630Z","review_batch":"nl-continuation-20261103-001"}},{"ref":"m499","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_id":3143},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":3143,"work_id":2984,"bound_author_id":23,"bound_title":"De bende van Anansi","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"9789024553853","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/12049561-L.jpg?default=false","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/12049561-M.jpg?default=false","evidence_url":"https://www.neilgaiman.com/works/books/anansi%2Bboys/ed/134/","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-499.json","sources":[{"url":"https://www.neilgaiman.com/works/books/anansi%2Bboys/ed/134/","role":"Primary author, novel identity and Charlie/unknown brother/Anansi narrative","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://boekenbalie.nl/de-bende-van-anansi/9789024553853","role":"Public search extract exact ISBN, Dutch paperback; direct open cache miss, not claimed complete page read","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://openlibrary.org/books/OL28294204M","role":"Pinned Dutch edition and translator Emmy van Beest; source record bound to Work2984","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"}],"decision":"Preserve Work2984 and Dutch edition3143. Full novel, not comic adaptation, TV edition, omnibus or sequel to American Gods. No new Work/edition. National-library extract absent for this ISBN; exact Dutch paperback corroborated by independent retailer plus source translator statement.","additionalCredits":[]},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","source":"https://www.neilgaiman.com/works/books/anansi%2Bboys/ed/134/","provenance":"prior_original_source_reviewed_summary","reference":"content-review-020.json"},{"type":"exact_edition_front_review","receipt":"cover-12049561.json","sha256":"17d62c009de6cc622a817bb010524267cfb1fd1b1a9c926a3cb5e9aadcf30c61","bytes":65985,"review":"Decoded Dutch front, Neil Gaiman / De bende van Anansi, blue lightning/web and city. Library-exemplar sticker obscures lower artwork, does not obscure title/author. Imperfection retained explicitly, not counted as placeholder.","limitation":"Front/source binding; no barcode claim, hosted loading not yet proven"}],"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:12.630Z","review_batch":"nl-continuation-20261103-001"}},{"ref":"d505","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":3348,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":3348,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":1549,"text":"De wees Puc groeit op bij een kasteel en wordt leerling van een magiër. Zijn vriend Tomas ziet een andere toekomst voor zich, maar de komst van indringers uit een vreemde wereld verandert hun plannen. Het koninkrijk raakt betrokken bij een oorlog die door scheuren tussen werelden mogelijk wordt. Terwijl Puc zijn talent leert begrijpen, komt ook Tomas tegenover onbekende krachten te staan. Hun verschillende wegen verbinden een plaatselijk conflict met gebeurtenissen die ver buiten hun eigen wereld reiken.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://crydee.com/","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-505.json","sources":[{"url":"https://crydee.com/","role":"Primary author site, Pug/Tomas/Crydee and rift invasion synopsis","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://www.deslegte.com/magier-leerling-meester-997894/","role":"Exact paperback ISBN9789029054225, Meulenhoff-M,736pages, both books in one complete novel","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p159532574","role":"Pinned Dutch language, full-author identity and original1982 prose Magician linkage","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"}],"decision":"Work3348 is complete1982 prose Magician, ISBN9789029054225 explicitly contains Leerling and Meester. Reject comic OL37818268W/Brett Booth adaptation and partial volume. Do not add the alternative hardcover editions or merge comic and novel. Existing Work/edition3507 retained.","additionalCredits":[]},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","source":"https://crydee.com/","provenance":"prior_original_source_reviewed_summary","reference":"content-review-020.json"},{"type":"exact_edition_front_review","receipt":"cover-8770815.json","sha256":"41023bb0f33ebea8050a9c702be21ddc12704ace71313c44a89b1b0e12643d4a","bytes":26186,"review":"Decoded ochre Meulenhoff-M front, Raymond E Feist / Magiër / Eerste boek Leerling Tweede boek Meester, candle and open book. Confirms complete novel rather than comic or first half.","limitation":"Front/source binding; no barcode claim, hosted loading not yet proven"}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:12.630Z","review_batch":"nl-continuation-20261103-001"}},{"ref":"m505","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_id":3507},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":3507,"work_id":3348,"bound_author_id":1549,"bound_title":"Magiër","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"978902905422