4,"open_library_edition_id":"OL27738260M","isbn_10":"9027447845","isbn_13":"9789027447845","language":"dut","publisher":"Het Spectrum","title":"Te wapen"}},{"ref":"d506","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":3414,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":3414,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":22,"text":"Een pas bevorderde korporaal krijgt de verantwoordelijkheid voor nieuwe rekruten van de stadswacht van Ankh-Meurbork. In een stad waar ook misdaad haar eigen organisatie kent, is de orde bewaren al geen eenvoudige taak. Een oud document maakt de situatie nog ingewikkelder door de vraag op te werpen wie eigenlijk recht heeft op de troon. De werkzaamheden van de wacht raken zo verstrengeld met verwachtingen rond afkomst en macht. Pratchett plaatst zijn bewakers midden in die onwaarschijnlijke politieke verwikkelingen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://terrypratchett.com/books/men-at-arms/","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-506.json","sources":[{"url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p149228244","role":"Pinned Dutch exact edition, full-author authority and original Men at arms1993","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://terrypratchett.com/books/men-at-arms/","role":"Official author site, City Watch novel identity","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://www.bol.com/nl/nl/p/te-wapen/666808039/","role":"Exact ISBN9789027447845, Dutch paperback280pages","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL453739W","role":"Pinned detailed synopsis used for prior original draft; not copied praise or text","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"}],"decision":"KB full authority Terence David John Pratchett includes Terry (Sir) alias under the same authority, corroborated by exact ISBN/title. This resolves author-format flag, no person merge. Existing Work3414 retained; complete prose Men at Arms, not stage adaptation. Exact proposed paperback is Dutch; other existing edition must be checked before deciding whether new ISBN is needed. Current exact-title collision reviewed separately: Pratchett MenAtArms1993 vs HeinVanDolen/Hekster/Meijer classical-battle essays2015 ISBN9789025305925. University repository chapter explicitly verifies separate anthology.","additionalCredits":[]},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","source":"https://terrypratchett.com/books/men-at-arms/","provenance":"prior_original_source_reviewed_summary","reference":"content-review-021.json"},{"type":"exact_edition_front_review","receipt":"cover-11339183.json","sha256":"8ee16240b9fa67331c9d15cd4ae56b821a639f3222fb3d9d08f2ce3982e99ec8","bytes":49105,"review":"Decoded Dutch Spectrum Te Wapen / Terry Pratchett / Schijfwereld15, illustrated guards. Two old sale labels cover part of lower artwork, not title/author. Correct identity but imperfect scan; clean variant remains separate quality task.","limitation":"Front/source binding; no barcode claim, hosted loading not yet proven"}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:12.630Z","review_batch":"nl-continuation-20261103-001"}},{"ref":"m506","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_id":"@e506"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@e506","work_id":3414,"bound_author_id":22,"bound_title":"Te wapen","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"9789027447845","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/11339183-L.jpg?default=false","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/11339183-M.jpg?default=false","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p149228244","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-506.json","sources":[{"url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p149228244","role":"Pinned Dutch exact edition, full-author authority and original Men at arms1993","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://terrypratchett.co