n_id":"OL9097908M","isbn_10":"9035107004","isbn_13":"9789035107007","language":"dut","publisher":"Bert Bakker","title":"De slinger van Foucault"}},{"ref":"d507","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":2668,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":2668,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":52,"text":"Drie redacteuren in Milaan krijgen bij hun uitgeverij teksten over geheime genootschappen en verborgen geschiedenis onder ogen. Voor hun eigen vermaak bouwen ze uit zulke ideeën een allesomvattend complot. Historische gebeurtenissen en toevallige verbanden krijgen daarin een plaats, alsof één plan de wereld bestuurt. Maar het verschil tussen hun verzinsel en de overtuigingen van anderen wordt steeds moeilijker te bewaken. Hun intellectuele spel brengt hen in gevaar en roept de vraag op hoe gemakkelijk mensen betekenis maken van losse aanwijzingen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://uitgeverijprometheus.nl/boeken/slinger-van-foucault-e-boek/","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-507.json","sources":[{"url":"https://uitgeverijprometheus.nl/boeken/slinger-van-foucault-e-boek/","role":"Primary publisher, narrative about three Milanese editors constructing a conspiracy; ebook used for content only","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p065342798","role":"Pinned exact Dutch1989 title/language/UmbertoEco identity","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://www.untje.com/fr/fiction/fiction-particularites/fiction-traduite/de-slinger-van-foucault-paperback-umberto-eco-yond-boeke-patty-krone-1989_104423_93209/","role":"Exact9789035107007 paperback Amsterdam Bakker; confirms publisher typo correction","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://www.deslegte.com/amsterdam/de-slinger-van-foucault-157990/","role":"Existing alternative ISBN9789035113862 paperback independently confirmed; translator not treated as coauthor","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"}],"decision":"Preserve Work2668 and existing Dutch Ooievaar paperback2827/ISBN9789035113862. New verified1989 Bakker edition9789035107007 is an alternative presentation only, not extra Dutch availability. Never bind its dark-blue cover to Ooievaar ISBN. Production plan should prefer existing suitable edition if an exact cover can be verified; alternative must be an explicit edition action if selected. Source publisher spelling Bert Baker corrected to Bert Bakker only for the exact new edition.","additionalCredits":[]},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","source":"https://uitgeverijprometheus.nl/boeken/slinger-van-foucault-e-boek/","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","reference":null},{"type":"exact_edition_front_review","receipt":"cover-11618004.json","sha256":"92ea885a5730ea54b420f7c7921540f6b3ca081e878ea56e2ecb7191cd94e35d","bytes":32540,"review":"Decoded dark blue/black front with gold Umberto Eco / de slinger van Foucault and printed uitgeverij bert bakker. Correct alternative1989 ISBN; not bound to existing Ooievaar edition.","limitation":"Front/source binding; no barcode claim, hosted loading not yet proven"}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:12.630Z","review_batch":"nl-continuation-20261103-001"}},{"ref":"m507","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_id":"@e507"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@e507","work_id":2668,"bound_author_id":52,"bound_title":"De slinger van Foucault","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"9789035107007","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/11618004-L.jpg?default=false","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/11618004-M.jpg?default=false","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p065342798","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-507.json","sources":[{"url":"https://uitgeverijprometheus.nl/boeken/slinger