proved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:12.630Z","review_batch":"nl-continuation-20261103-001"}},{"ref":"efix3530","relation":"editions","key":{"id":3530},"before":{"id":3530,"title":"De kinderen van Hurin","isbn_10":"9089681841","isbn_13":"9789089681843","work_id":3371,"language":"dut","publisher":null,"created_at":"2026-10-03T14:36:16.743524+00:00","open_library_edition_id":"OL28345253M"},"after":{"id":3530,"title":"De kinderen van Hurin","isbn_10":"9089681841","isbn_13":"9789089681843","work_id":3371,"language":"dut","publisher":"Mynx","created_at":"2026-10-03T14:36:16.743524+00:00","open_library_edition_id":"OL28345253M"}},{"ref":"d515","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":3371,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":3371,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":6,"text":"Lang voor de gebeurtenissen uit In de ban van de ring verzet Húrin zich tegen Morgoth, de duistere macht in het noorden. De gevolgen daarvan treffen ook zijn kinderen Túrin en Niënor. Hun levens raken verstrikt in oorlog en in de vijandschap die Morgoth tegen hun vader koestert. De draak Glaurung speelt met misleiding een beslissende rol in de dreiging rond hen. Tolkien vertelt een sombere geschiedenis waarin familiebanden en persoonlijke keuzes onder uitzonderlijke druk komen te staan.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://www.tolkienestate.com/writing/the-children-of-hurin/","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-515.json","sources":[{"url":"https://www.tolkienestate.com/writing/the-children-of-hurin/","role":"Primary literary estate; complete standalone edited narrative, Morgoth and Húrins children; distinguishes fragments","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p320323773","role":"Pinned exact Dutch ISBN, translator and original2007 narrative","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://www.lannoo.com/nl-nl/fantasy-sciencefiction/de-kinderen-van-hurin-9789089681843","role":"Publisher group exact Dutch-title paperback search extract; direct open failed, not claimed complete page","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/18942/de-kinderen-van-hurin.html","role":"Print format/publisher corroboration; English language field conflicts with independently verified Dutch translation, recorded not blindly copied","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://www.standaardboekhandel.be/p/de-kinderen-van-hurin-9789089681843","role":"Exact ISBN Dutch retail listing; independent edition corroboration","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"}],"decision":"Preserve Work3371, exact paperback3530. Missing publisher resolved as historical Mynx imprint of Meulenhoff Boekerij; current registry imprint Boekerij not a second Work. Hurin/Húrin is accent normalization, not different identity. Registry incorrectly marks this print ISBN English; exact KB Dutch translation/translator, Dutch publisher listing and Dutch physical front override that disputed field. Christopher Tolkien editor remains distinct from JRR author. No language guessing from cover alone.","additionalCredits":[]},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","source":"https://www.tolkienestate.com/writing/the-children-of-hurin/","provenance":"prior_original_source_reviewed_summary","reference":"content-review-021.json"},{"type":"exact_edition_front_review","receipt":"cover-10293573.json","sha256":"cf18f023d7991a4c37f68f195039fb51c16dc15e5dbb0b4c22523658fe082c1d","bytes":29990,"review":"Decoded grey runic front, JRR Tolkien / De kinderen van Húrin, warrior crest and red MYNX mark. Bound to exact paperback ISBN, no barcode assertion.","limitation":"Front/source binding; no barcode claim, hosted loading not yet proven"}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:12.630Z","review_batch":"nl-continuation-20261103-001"}},{"ref":"m515","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_id