 editor remains distinct from JRR author. No language guessing from cover alone.","additionalCredits":[]},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","source":"https://www.tolkienestate.com/writing/the-children-of-hurin/","provenance":"prior_original_source_reviewed_summary","reference":"content-review-021.json"},{"type":"exact_edition_front_review","receipt":"cover-10293573.json","sha256":"cf18f023d7991a4c37f68f195039fb51c16dc15e5dbb0b4c22523658fe082c1d","bytes":29990,"review":"Decoded grey runic front, JRR Tolkien / De kinderen van Húrin, warrior crest and red MYNX mark. Bound to exact paperback ISBN, no barcode assertion.","limitation":"Front/source binding; no barcode claim, hosted loading not yet proven"}],"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:12.630Z","review_batch":"nl-continuation-20261103-001"}},{"ref":"d517","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":3364,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":3364,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":80,"text":"Dit boek presenteert zich als een naslagwerk uit de wereld van Harry Potter. Onder de naam van de fictieve sportkenner Kennilworthy Whisp beschrijft Rowling hoe zwerkbal zich door de eeuwen heen heeft ontwikkeld. De lezer vindt er uitleg over regels, overtredingen, bekende ploegen en de veranderingen aan wedstrijdbezems. Het is geen nieuw avontuur van Harry, maar een aanvulling op de tovenaarswereld waarin de sport zo belangrijk is. De geschiedenis en bijzonderheden horen bij die verzonnen wereld.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://www.jkrowling.com/book/quidditch-through-the-ages/","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-517.json","sources":[{"url":"https://www.jkrowling.com/book/quidditch-through-the-ages/","role":"Primary author; fictional reference identity, history/rules/fouls/teams/brooms and fictional credit","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://www