en. Wanneer ze ontdekt dat anderen eveneens zulke onverwachte gaven bezitten, gaat ze naar hen op zoek. Ze wil bondgenoten verzamelen tegen het bewind dat haar probeert te beheersen. Koning Maven zet ondertussen de achtervolging in. In dit tweede deel van de Rode koningin-reeks wordt Mares verzet steeds gevaarlijker, ook doordat de keuzes die ze maakt haar eigen overtuigingen onder druk zetten.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://victoriaaveyard.com/book/glass-sword/","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-520.json","sources":[{"url":"https://victoriaaveyard.com/book/glass-sword/","role":"Primary author, exact sequel identity and Mare/Maven/newblood recruitment premise","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p401535835","role":"Pinned exact Dutch print ISBN/title/language/original2016","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://www.nl.fnac.be/a9614379/Rode-koningin-serie-Deel-2-Zwaard-van-glas-Victoria-Aveyard","role":"Exact9789023498070 Dutch paperback, translators and publisher","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"}],"decision":"Existing Work2648/edition2807, book2 of Red Queen preserved. Replace unreliable reader synopsis as evidence with author primary account. Cargo imprint and De Bezige Bij publisher group are compatible, not different Works. Translators remain separate from original author.","additionalCredits":[]},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","source":"https://victoriaaveyard.com/book/glass-sword/","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","reference":null},{"type":"exact_edition_front_review","receipt":"cover-8737559.json","sha256":"e5e206877b1064ff4cab1cf487052d4ca9d9bb9f70c8e8b237a05e281ec32527","bytes":31976,"review":"Decoded Dutch Cargo front, Victoria Aveyard / Zwaard van glas, silver crown and red drops. Exact ISBN-bound cover; no source fan synopsis used.","limitation":"Front/source binding; no barcode claim, hosted loading not yet proven"}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:12.630Z","review_batch":"nl-continuation-20261103-001"}},{"ref":"m520","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_id":2807},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":2807,"work_id":2648,"bound_author_id":118,"bound_title":"Zwaard van Glas","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"9789023498070","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/8737559-L.jpg?default=false","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/8737559-M.jpg?default=false","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p401535835","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-520.json","sources":[{"url":"https://victoriaaveyard.com/book/glass-sword/","role":"Primary author, exact sequel identity and Mare/Maven/newblood recruitment premise","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p401535835","role":"Pinned exact Dutch print ISBN/title/language/original2016","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://www.nl.fnac.be/a9614379/Rode-koningin-serie-Deel-2-Zwaard-van-glas-Victoria-Aveyard","role":"Exact9789023498070 Dutch paperback, translators and publisher","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"}],"decision":"Existing Work2648/edition2807, book2 of Red Queen preserved. Replace unreliable reader synopsis as evidence with author primary account. Cargo imprint and De Bezige Bij publisher group are compatible, not different Works. Translators remain separate from original author.","additionalCredits":[]},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","source":"https://victoriaaveyard.com/book/glass-sword/","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","reference":null},{"type":"exact_edition_front_review","receipt":"cover-8737559.json","sha256":"e5e206877b1064ff4cab1cf487052d4ca9d9bb9f70c8e8b237a05e281ec32527","bytes":31976,"review":"Decoded Dutch Cargo front, Victoria Aveyard / Zwaard van glas, silver crown and red drops. Exact ISBN-bound cover; no source fan synopsis used.","limitation":"Front/source binding; no barcode claim, hosted loading not yet proven"}],"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:12.630Z","review_batch":"nl-continuation-20261103-001"}},{"ref":"d521","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":3276,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":3276,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":179,"text":"Jaren na de ramp in Jurassic Park duiken aanwijzingen op dat dinosauriërs niet allemaal verdwenen zijn. Ian Malcolm raakt betrokken bij een expeditie naar een tweede eiland, waar de dieren buiten het oog van de wereld verder hebben geleefd. De onderzoekers willen begrijpen wat zich daar heeft ontwikkeld, maar hun aanwezigheid brengt grote risico’s mee. Bovendien hebben concurrenten heel andere bedoelingen met het genetische materiaal. De zoektocht naar kennis verandert in een strijd om veilig uit een onvoorspelbare omgeving weg te komen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://michaelcrichton.com/works/the-lost-world/","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-521.json","sources":[{"url":"https://michaelcrichton.com/works/the-lost-world/","role":"Primary author estate, novel research-team/second island/dinosaur and competing expedition premise; not film synopsis","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p159512298","role":"Pinned exact Dutch ISBN9789024519569, language and Knopf1995 original","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"}],"decision":"Preserve Work3276/edition3435 as full Crichton1995 novel sequel. Dutch1997 movie-tie-in cover is not a film screenplay or Conan Doyle1912 work. No omnibus or part2/2 substituted. Exact KB original linkage and translated subtitle bind identity.","additionalCredits":[]},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","source":"https://michaelcrichton.com/works/the-lost-world/","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","reference":null},{"type":"exact_edition_front_review","receipt":"cover-12149641.json","sha256":"55057ffcebb6b56f3346465f3ef548ae87349108b1e4079434cab03bac73a905","bytes":715031,"review":"Decoded black Dutch1997 film-tie-in novel front, Michael Crichton / The Lost World / (De verloren wereld), Jurassic dinosaur emblem. Film promotion does not change bibliographically confirmed novel identity.","limitation":"Front/source binding; no barcode claim, hosted loading not yet proven"}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:12.630Z","review_batch":"nl-continuation-20261103-001"}},{"ref":"m521","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_id":3435},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":3435,"work_id":3276,"bound_author_id":179,"bound_title":"De verloren wereld","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"9789024519569","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/12149641-L.jpg?default=false","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/12149641-M.jpg?default=false","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p159512298","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-521.json","sources":[{"url":"https://michaelcrichton.com/works/the-lost-world/","role":"Primary author estate, novel research-team/second island/dinosaur and competing expedition premise; not film synopsis","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p159512298","role":"Pinned exact Dutch ISBN9789024519569, language and Knopf1995 original","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"}],"decision":"Preserve Work3276/edition3435 as full Crichton1995 novel sequel. Dutch1997 movie-tie-in cover is not a film screenplay or Conan Doyle1912 work. No omnibus or part2/2 substituted. Exact KB original linkage and translated subtitle bind identity.","additionalCredits":[]},{"type":"original_s