n de kwantummechanica daarin hebben aangebracht. Vragen over de richting van de tijd, het begin van het heelal en de samenhang tussen natuurwetten vormen de rode draad. Met voorbeelden uit het dagelijks leven probeert hij moeilijke ideeën toegankelijk te maken. Ook bespreekt hij theorieën die verder reiken dan wat al experimenteel is bevestigd.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/71273/the-fabric-of-the-cosmos-by-brian-greene/","evidence":[{"type":"exact_edition_and_work_identity","reference":"reviewed-549.json","sources":[{"url":"https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/71273/the-fabric-of-the-cosmos-by-brian-greene/","role":"Primary publisher substantive space/time, relativity, quantum and cosmology scope; speculative theories attributed not asserted proven","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p307987353","role":"Pinned exact Dutch ISBN/title/author and Knopf2004 original","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"},{"url":"https://openlibrary.org/books/OL24946953M","role":"Pinned exact printed Spectrum edition; existing review-praise-only description not used as content","checkedOn":"2026-11-03"}],"decision":"Keep Work2402/edition2630, exact Dutch Spectrum paperback9789027469830. KB original identifies The Fabric of the Cosmos, not The Elegant Universe by same physicist. BrianRGreene expanded name resolves through exact original/ISBN authority and source-author alternate name; no name-only person merge. Nonfiction, no automatic taste eligibility.","additionalCredits":[]},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","source":"https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/71273/the-fabric-of-the-cosmos-by-brian-greene/","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","reference":null},{"type":"exact_edition_front_review","receipt":"cover-6878635.json","sha256":"538e2bb27979ae9a5999e2249fe9283a79ccba62f4a6a9d142903b271bd92d39","bytes":23903,"revie